+/* Texture-filter fragment-shader blocks ported from DuckStation
+ * (src/core/gpu_hw_shadergen.cpp, GPU_HW_ShaderGen::WriteBatchTextureFilter),
+ * verbatim apart from: (1) the xBR I.w coverage test reading texel I rather
